WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.101 line:92%
-Trump made an unplanned visit

00:00:01.101 --> 00:00:03.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
to Walter Reed Medical Cente
on Saturday.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:04.170 size:84% position:42% line:92%
He tweeted he was there

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:07.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
to visit the family
of a young man having surgery.

00:00:07.574 --> 00:00:08.475 line:92%
And while he was there, he said,

00:00:08.475 --> 00:00:11.911 size:81% position:41%
"Also began phase one
of my yearly physical.

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:14.414 line:92%
Everything very good. Great.

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.082 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:17.717 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Phase one of a physical?

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:19.586 size:78% position:39% line:92%
That sounded strange.

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
So we did some digging
and discovered

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:23.289 align:start size:94% position:6%
that his annual physical
has five phases.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:23.957 size:88% position:44% line:92%
So let's take a look now

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:28.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
at the five phases of
Donald Trump's annual physical

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:30.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
Phase one, measure
his official height

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:33.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
and negotiate
his official weight.

00:00:33.433 --> 00:00:35.435 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:38.805 align:start size:94% position:6%
Phase two,
a complete strip, spackle,

00:00:38.805 --> 00:00:41.574 size:88% position:44% line:92%
priming, and repainting.

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:45.745 align:start size:94% position:6%
Phase three, his annual batter
of paternity tests.

00:00:45.745 --> 00:00:47.614 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:52.419
Phase four, surgically remov
his hand from a Nutella jar.

00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:55.355
And finally, phase five, ask
about getting breast implants.

00:00:55.355 --> 00:00:58.658
Not the procedure -- He just
wants to play around with them

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:01.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter, applause ]
This has been the five phase

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:04.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
of Donald Trump's
annual physical.

